{"t":"Adventurers' Guild","s":"adventurers-guild-a9fff","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Adventurers_Guild_1_218183.png","q":13,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Adventurers' Guild</h2>\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"map\">\n<img alt=\"Adventurers Guild (+1)\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" height=\"218\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Adventurers_Guild_1_218183.png\" width=\"270\"/>\n</figure>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"ruler\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Ruled by</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Rotem%20Valos\">Rotem Valos</a></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"population\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Population</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"organization\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Organizations</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Adventurers' Guild</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Local</caption>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Hunting Places</th>\n<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\">Quests</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"implemented\"><div class=\"geo-toc\"><center><b>None</b></center></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other Properties</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"implementation-date\">9.80<br/>December 12, 2012<br/>Winter Update 2012</span></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-closed\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">More images</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"map2\">\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><p> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"ground floor\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"96\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Adventurers_Guild_0_b8e5ae.png\" width=\"125\"/></span></p><p><br/> </p><p><br/> </p></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><p>\t    See also: Locations <span class=\"explained\">Help</span></p></nav>\n</aside>\n<p><br/>\nThe <b>Adventurers' Guild</b> is a society of adventurers whose mission is to provide help and information to young adventurers. They are located on an <a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"32200,32300,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">island (32200, 32300, 7)</a> east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Calcanea\">Calcanea</a> and west of <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a>' <a href=\"#/wiki/Thais%20Lighthouse\">Lighthouse</a>.\n</p><p>Their guild can be accessed by using an <a href=\"#/wiki/Adventurer%27s%20Stone\">Adventurer's Stone</a> <i>in</i> any city's <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">temple</a>. Players can get their first stone on the ship at the <a href=\"#/wiki/Island%20of%20Destiny\">Island of Destiny</a> or ask any <a href=\"#/wiki/Temple\">Temple</a> NPCs for an \"Adventurers' Stone\".\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Unique Objects</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></th><th style=\"\">Notes</th></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"#/wiki/The%20World%20Board\">The World Board</a></td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"The World Board\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/The_World_Board_d4dd37.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></td><td>When used, it will print information about currently active Mini World Changes in the Server Log.</td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Reward%20Chest\">Reward Chest</a></td><td class=\"item-animation\" style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 64px;\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Reward Chest\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"64\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Reward_Chest_813f64.gif\" width=\"64\"/></span></td><td>Reward Containers that weren't looted from a corpse will appear inside this chest. Once every item inside a container is taken, it will disappear from the chest.</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-NPCs\">NPCs</span></h2>\n<table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"wikitable sortable full-width\"><caption>Adventurers' Guild NPCs (7 NPCs)</caption><tbody><tr><th>Name</th><th class=\"npc-animation\" style=\"width: 128px;